📘 PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD v2)
AI-Powered Mentor Learning Platform (Multilingual, Video + Audio + AI Summaries)

A comprehensive mentorship platform combining long-form interviews, short videos, multilingual AI, learning paths, community interaction, and gamification.

1. Product Overview

This platform brings real-world expertise from professionals, entrepreneurs, and industry veterans to users through:

Long-format mentor interviews

Multiple short clips per session

AI-generated multilingual transcripts, English translations, summaries, and key learnings

Video, text, and audio-only formats

Interaction features: comments, mentor Q&A, community discussion

Gamification & completion certificates

Corporate & school plans for bulk access

Users subscribe (via Cashfree) to access all content.
Admins manage mentors, videos, short clips, AI outputs, and community moderation.

2. Goals & Success Metrics
2.1 Goals

Democratise mentorship across India and globally

Make vernacular knowledge searchable and accessible in English

Build a premium learning experience through expert interviews

Increase engagement by adding interaction & gamification

Enable companies/schools to adopt structured learning paths

2.2 Metrics

Video watch time per session

Completion rates

